{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"update","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"entryID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/EntryID","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel7EntryIDV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dynamic","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Dynamic","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Dynamic","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel7DynamicV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"extras","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Extras","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10XestiTools6ExtrasV"},{"text":"? = nil) -> (updated","kind":"text"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", removedEntryID","kind":"text"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/EntryID","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel7EntryIDV"},{"text":"?)","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The identity of the entry to replace. An","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identity naming no entry is ignored.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"entryID"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The new dynamic level for the entry.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"dynamic"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The new optional extra data for the entry.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"name":"extras"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A pair of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"updated"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" if ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"text":" identified an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entry and it was updated, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":" if ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"text":" named no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entry and nothing happened — and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"removedEntryID"},{"text":", the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identity of the pre-existing entry dropped because the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edit collapsed into it (see above). ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" if ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"updated"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":", or if it is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" but no such collision","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"occurred.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/DynamicMap\/remove(entryID:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" followed by an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/DynamicMap\/insert(time:dynamic:extras:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps the entry’s identity and does not reorder entries. Reordering only matters when more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than one entry shares a time: insertion always lands after every entry already at that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"time, so a remove-then-insert edit of one entry among ties silently changes the order of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entries that were never touched. And — unlike a position — the identity keeps addressing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this same entry across any other entry’s edit, so a caller never needs to re-resolve it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The edit can turn this entry into an exact duplicate of another one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already at the same time — same time, dynamic level, and extras —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same combination ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/DynamicMap\/insert(time:dynamic:extras:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" silently","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collapses. When that happens, ","type":"text"},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" always keeps addressing the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entry that was just updated; the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"other","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", pre-existing entry is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one silently removed instead. That is the only choice consistent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the guarantee above: a caller invoking this method already","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holds ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"text":" and goes on using it afterward, so honoring “this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identity keeps addressing this same entry” means the entry it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wasn’t referencing has to be the one that gives way, never the one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it was.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/DynamicMap\/update(entryID:dynamic:extras:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"Replaces the dynamic entry with the given identity, in place.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormodel\/dynamicmap\/update(entryid:dynamic:extras:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/DynamicMap"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"update","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"entryID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel7EntryIDV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dynamic","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Dynamic","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel7DynamicV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"extras","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Extras","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10XestiTools6ExtrasV"},{"text":"?) -> (updated","kind":"text"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", removedEntryID","kind":"text"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel7EntryIDV"},{"text":"?)","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"update(entryID:dynamic:extras:)","externalID":"s:9Ivo